{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "MOTTAINAI GHOST",
    "steam_appid": 3085200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some light surprise elements, but no grotesque imagery or violent scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nevertheless, it offers a strong sense of gloom and unease fitting for a horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a recommended \u201cintro to horror\u201d game for those who are curious about horror but don\u2019t like overly scary content, or for children to enjoy safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the dream of making a fortune through vacation rentals, you purchase an old, secondhand apartment building.<br>However, an abnormal situation unfolds as guests begin disappearing one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to uncover the cause of these strange occurrences, you thoroughly investigate each room, only to face the wrath of discarded leftovers and their lingering grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape from the mansion, but standing in your way is &quot;leftover food.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By eating leftovers, your stomach level increases, allowing you to consume even larger portions. Efficiently leveling up your stomach is the key to escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To support your exploration, items that enhance your senses, such as smell and vision, are available. Additionally, an auto-mapping feature is included to prevent you from getting lost, ensuring a comfortable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape from this harsh mansion safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ghost Story Rooted in Japanese Culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered on the spirit of &quot;<i>MOTTAINAI</i>&quot;, this game reimagines Japanese folklore as a modern horror experience.<br>Discover the terror lurking just beneath the surface of everyday life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-Based Horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate every room in the apartment building, uncovering hidden items and notes that reveal the truth behind the strange events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Over if Caught by the <i>MOTTAINAI GHOST</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the <i>MOTTAINAI GHOST</i> roaming the property.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will determine your survival.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some light surprise elements, but no grotesque imagery or violent scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nevertheless, it offers a strong sense of gloom and unease fitting for a horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a recommended \u201cintro to horror\u201d game for those who are curious about horror but don\u2019t like overly scary content, or for children to enjoy safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the dream of making a fortune through vacation rentals, you purchase an old, secondhand apartment building.<br>However, an abnormal situation unfolds as guests begin disappearing one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to uncover the cause of these strange occurrences, you thoroughly investigate each room, only to face the wrath of discarded leftovers and their lingering grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape from the mansion, but standing in your way is &quot;leftover food.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By eating leftovers, your stomach level increases, allowing you to consume even larger portions. Efficiently leveling up your stomach is the key to escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To support your exploration, items that enhance your senses, such as smell and vision, are available. Additionally, an auto-mapping feature is included to prevent you from getting lost, ensuring a comfortable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape from this harsh mansion safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ghost Story Rooted in Japanese Culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered on the spirit of &quot;<i>MOTTAINAI</i>&quot;, this game reimagines Japanese folklore as a modern horror experience.<br>Discover the terror lurking just beneath the surface of everyday life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-Based Horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate every room in the apartment building, uncovering hidden items and notes that reveal the truth behind the strange events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Over if Caught by the <i>MOTTAINAI GHOST</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the <i>MOTTAINAI GHOST</i> roaming the property.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will determine your survival.</p>",
    "short_description": "Don't allow food waste! A horror-flavored, exploration-based gluttonous adventure game where you aim to escape the apartment while running from the MOTTAINAI GHOST!",
